\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 In-Scope:
\f1\b0  Real-time ingestion of patient vitals from IoT hospital beds, mapping data to the FHIR R4 standard, and exposing a secure API for third-party reporting tools.\
\ls3\ilvl0
\f0\b \kerning1\expnd0\expndtw0 \outl0\strokewidth0 {\listtext	\uc0\u8226 	}\expnd0\expndtw0\kerning0
\outl0\strokewidth0 \strokec2 Ambiguity/Contested Scope:
\f1\b0  The data migration of legacy on-prem records is currently unresolved. It is undecided if this will be a batch process or an event-driven stream. 
\f2\i Note: Ownership here is contested. Clinical Ops assumes IT owns migration; IT assumes the External Vendor owns it. Currently, there is no single Accountable owner named for the migration epic.
\f1\i0 \
\pard\pardeftab720\sa240\partightenfactor0

